+| objects `n` | `d` | `p` | classification updates | median / maximum wall time |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1,448 | 2 | 12 | 2,896 | 0.000266 / 0.000283 s |
+| 10,000 | 2 | 22 | 20,000 | 0.001850 / 0.002537 s |
+| 100,000 | 2 | 47 | 200,000 | 0.019107 / 0.019767 s |
