324:This follows from the simple standard transformation from \textsc{Not-All-Equal 3-Sat} to \textsc{3-Sat}: Given an instance of {\sc Monotone NAE-3-Sat-E4} where the formula is linear, introduce for each clause $\{\ell_1, \ell_2, \ell_3\}$ a second clause $\{\neg \ell_1, \neg \ell_2, \neg \ell_3\}$. Note that the resulting formula has the desired properties. 
