+`n^O(alpha-mod(G))` for Two Sets Cut-Uncut, and Theorem 16 specializes it to
+`2^O(n^(1-1/(d+1)) log n)` on the geometric class. These are genuine
+algorithms and cannot be hidden in a Track A claim.
